  "landmarks": {
    "note": "Detected from the oriented mesh. Heights are fractions of the mesh height H, lengths of its length L. A recipe may override any landmark with model-space [x, y, z] under rig.landmarks. tailOptional: a shelled body may have no tail; a missing tail path places the tail bones by proportion without a warning. headRegionFraction is smaller than the quadruped's so the head region holds the head beyond the shell's front edge, not the dome.",
