    "secondaryLagFrames": 1,
    "settleFrames": 2,
    "lieDropFraction": 0.62,
    "lieNote": "sleep, downed and recovery put the belly on the ground: the trunk drops this fraction of the hip height while the paws stay planted (C3d).",
